## The port and its storage records

`ExtractionWorkflow` gains `IExtractionStore` — eight append members and two
firm-scoped reads — plus the storage record shapes and the parallel structural
audit vocabulary. `ExtractionAuditKind` is a **parallel** enum; no member was
added to the merged `ClientIntake.Models.IntakeAuditKind`.

Records: `ExtractionAuditEventRecord`, `ExtractionCorrectionRecord`,
`ClassificationOverrideRecord`, `DuplicateCandidateRecord`,
`DuplicateResolutionRecord`, `ExtractionAcceptanceRecord`,
`StoredDocumentExtraction`, `StoredCaseExtractions`, and the
`StoredExtractionProvenance` factory. Vocabularies: `ExtractionAuditKind`,
`ExtractionActorKind`, `DuplicateResolutionKind`, `ExtractionAcceptanceScope`,
`ExtractionStoreWriteCode`.

`StoredExtractionProvenance` exists so the storage adapter never names a
`DocumentExtraction` type: `Persistence`'s boundary forbids that token, and a
boundary that depends on nobody typing a namespace is not a boundary.

