Migration identifier: **`20260803000000_AddDocumentExtraction`**. It creates ten
tables and drops the same ten. It contains no `AlterTable`, `AlterColumn`,
`AddColumn`, `DropColumn`, `RenameTable`, `RenameColumn`, `InsertData`,
`UpdateData`, `DeleteData`, or raw `Sql` operation, and touches no table outside
the ten. `20260729021907_InitialPersistence` and `20260730000000_AddClientIntake`
are byte-unchanged; the model snapshot diff is purely additive and keeps its
`internal sealed partial` house form.

